## To release a new version, edit the version in the two lines below and nothing else.
## |cRRGGBB...|r in Title and Author colours them in the in-game add-on list; the version
## is read back through that markup, so it can sit inside or outside the colour.
## The settings panel takes its version from ## Title; the name itself is fixed in PBsKillLog.lua.
## Title: |cFF69B4PB's KillLog|r 1.3.0
## Author: |cFF69B4PinkBanther|r
## Description: Shows only the PvP player kill feed in its own window, in Cyrodiil, even when the chat "PvP Kill Feed" setting is off. Position, size, font size and draw layer are adjustable, with a preview frame while the settings are open.
## Version: 1.3.0
## APIVersion: 101050 101051
## OptionalDependsOn: LibHarvensAddonSettings>=20106
## SavedVariables: PBsKillLog_SavedVars
